  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3C0VYQR/title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"973\" height=\"130\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>（與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/m_productions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">M Productions</a> 合作，亦即 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-man-from-the-fog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Man From The Fog</a> 的創作者）</strong></span></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>本專案自第二章起將僅支援 1.20.1 版本。</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#999\">&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/kmz8VJF/description.png\" width=\"407\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這裡沒有其他人。<br>除了你自己之外，空無一人。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你被詛咒必須獨自徘徊於此領域的深處。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">獨自一人。<br></span></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你在這裡待得夠久了，開始感覺到還有另一個存在伴隨著你。<br>你感到擔憂。<br>你真的只是獨自一人嗎？還是那裡有某種東西在？<br>注視著？<br>等待著？<br>跟蹤中...？</span></em></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><em><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎來到 Apollyon。</span></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3djz9jF/The-Damned.png\" width=\"356\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">他們不是「居民」。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">他們極度厭惡這個稱呼……</span></em></span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">他們是極具韌性的生物。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><em><strong>他們正在感染你的世界……</strong></em></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">除非殺死目標或自身被擊殺，否則他們絕不離開。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><em><strong>他們就在你身後……</strong></em></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">他們只會鎖定單一目標。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><em><strong>他們已潛入你的意識……</strong></em></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">他們有時會選擇纏擾你，而非追獵你。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><em><strong>他們無所不在……</strong></em></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/31w5Zvz/modrequirements.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"579\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7CbQVFj/GeckoLib.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"35\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/gczs-horror-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k4K89G2/GCZ-s-Horror-Pack.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"35\"></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><strong>（一個包含 Apollyon 且版本超過 <em>Release v2.0.1</em> 的替代自訂整合包）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jn2HhgqxaF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2vgTkPV/Discord-Invite-Poster.png\" width=\"378\" height=\"130\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/gSQ2yDkyDN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/x8YqKTg/Discord-Invite-Poster.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"130\"></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qJvMdyS/Media.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"182\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/33me_Dvr4n4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"359\" width=\"359\"></iframe></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VNKw83CAeTs?wmode=transparent\" height=\"359\" width=\"359\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=787\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PZVrMGnp/Kinetic-Hosting-2025-Large-Banner.png\" width=\"570\" height=\"200\"></a></p>",
